---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---

<Layout>
	<div
		class="grid items-start bg-[url('assets/bg.jpg')] bg-position-[center_top_57px] bg-no-repeat min-h-dvh relative z-50
               
               min-[1920px]:w-[2560px] min-[1920px]:left-1/2 min-[1920px]:mr-[-50%] min-[1920px]:-translate-x-1/2"
	>
		<Nav />
		<main class="text-7xl font-bold pt-14.25">
			<p class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-4">
				Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Eaque
				sapiente ipsum ducimus! Autem earum animi rerum veniam sint
				debitis exercitationem fuga sit, sapiente totam iure deleniti
				delectus libero, accusamus inventore.Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet
				consectetur adipisicing elit.
			</p>
			<div
				class="relative w-[clamp(100%,90vw,1280px)] mx-auto py-16 px-4 my-16 bg-white text-2xl
            before:content-[''] before:absolute before:-top-12.5 before:left-0 before:w-full before:h-12.5 before:bg-[url('assets/divider_up.png')] before:bg-no-repeat before:bg-cover
            after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-12.5 after:left-0 after:w-full after:h-12.5 after:bg-[url('assets/divider_down.png')] after:bg-no-repeat after:bg-cover"
			>
				Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Culpa,
				blanditiis ipsum provident fugit expedita inventore tenetur
				libero repudiandae cumque. Hic nam sunt sint quisquam delectus
				illum aperiam architecto alias illo.
			</div>
			<p class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-4">
				Eaque sapiente ipsum ducimus! Autem earum animi rerum veniam
				sint debitis exercitationem fuga sit, sapiente totam iure
				deleniti delectus libero, accusamus inventore.Lorem ipsum dolor
				sit amet consectetur
			</p>
		</main>
	</div>
</Layout>
